  "translation": "Na king i givim komand ⟨את⟩ long Khilkiya, bikpela pris, na ⟨את⟩ ol pris bilong namba tu, na ⟨את⟩ ol man i lukautim dua — bilong rausim i kamap ausait long haos bilong Yahwe ⟨את⟩ olgeta ol samting we ol i wokim bilong Baal, na bilong Ashera, na bilong olgeta ami bilong skai; na em i burnim ol ausait long Yerusalayim, long ol gaden bilong Kidron, na em i karim ⟨את⟩ das bilong ol i go Bet-El.",
